{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45683","headline":"和杨使君游赤松山 · 贯休","name":"和杨使君游赤松山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲郡三星无一事，龚黄意外扳乔松。\n日边扬历不争路，云外苔藓须留踪。\n溪月未落漏滴滴，隼旟已入山重重。\n扪萝盖输山屐伴，驻斾不见朝霞浓。\n乳猨剧黠挂险树，露木翠脆生诸峰。\n初平谢公道非远，黯然物外心相逢。\n石羊依稀齕瑶草，桃花彷佛开仙宫。\n终当归补吾君衮，好山好水那相容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}